  "description": "A Roslyn incremental source generator that turns a partial class into a fully thread-safe, lock-free Active Object around a Stateless state machine. Decorate a class with [ActiveObject] and declare partial Task methods with [StateTrigger]; the generator emits the Channel-based mailbox, the single worker loop, the message records, the constructor and async disposal. The marker attributes are injected into your compilation automatically, so the package is analyzer-only and depends solely on Stateless.",
